hint:
The for loop iterates over each element. Syntax: {% for var in array %}
The loop variable (item) takes each value in turn. The block executes
once per element.

template:
{% capture x %}
a
b
c
{% endcapture %}{{ x | strip_newlines }}

{%- liquid
for i in (1..3)
  echo i
endfor
-%}

{%- for i in (1..5) -%}
  {%- # Skip even numbers explanation -%}
  {%- assign mod = i | modulo: 2 -%}
  {%- if mod != 0 -%}{{ i }}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
